msgstr "ປະຕິເສດ IP ຫຼືຊ່ວງ CIDR ສະເພາະບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄຊທ໌ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:263
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:323
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/twofa.html:6
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/user/twofa_settings.html:14
msgid "Two-Factor Authentication"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ (2FA)"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:266
msgid ""
"Use an authenticator app (Google Authenticator, Authy, etc.) to generate "
"one-time codes."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແອັບຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (Google Authenticator, Authy, ແລະອື່ນໆ) "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງລະຫັດຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:273
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:346
msgid "Passkey"
msgstr "Passkey"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:276
msgid ""
"Sign in with your device's fingerprint, face recognition, or a security key "
"- no password needed."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍລາຍນິ້ວມື, ການຈຳແນກໜ້າ, ຫຼືກະແຈຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ - "
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:313
msgid ""
"Enter one IP address or CIDR range per line. Leave empty to allow all IPs."
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຫຼືຊ່ວງ CIDR ໜຶ່ງລາຍການຕໍ່ແຖວ. ປະໄວ້ຫວ່າງເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດທຸກ IP."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:326
msgid "Setting up…"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າ…"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:330
msgid "Scan the QR code with your 2FA app, then enter the 6-digit code below."
msgstr ""
"ສະແກນລະຫັດ QR ດ້ວຍແອັບ 2FA ຂອງທ່ານ ຈາກນັ້ນໃສ່ລະຫັດ 6 ຕົວເລກຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:332
msgid "6-digit code"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ 6 ຕົວເລກ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:337
msgid "Two-Factor Authentication is now enabled."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ (2FA) ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:349
msgid "Follow your browser/device prompt to register a passkey…"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂອງບຣາວເຊີ/ອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ passkey…"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:352
msgid "Passkey saved."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ passkey ແລ້ວ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:362
msgid "You're all set! What would you like to do next?"
msgstr "ທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວ! ຢາກເຮັດຫຍັງຕໍ່ໄປ?"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:367
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/partials/_footer.html:79
msgid "Take the tour"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການນຳທ່ຽວ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:368
msgid ""
"A guided walkthrough of the OpenPanel UI and pages. You can also start it "
"anytime from the menu."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳທ່ຽວແບບມີຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບໜ້າຈໍ ແລະໜ້າຕ່າງໆຂອງ OpenPanel. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມມັນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາຈາກເມນູ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:374
msgid "Add a domain"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂດເມນ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:375
msgid "Point a domain to your account and start hosting it."
msgstr "ຊີ້ໂດເມນມາຫາບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ ແລະເລີ່ມໂຮສທ໌ມັນ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:381
msgid "Upload files"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:382
msgid "Upload your website files using the file manager."
msgstr "ອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ເວັບໄຊທ໌ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:388
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/mysql/wizard.html:183
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/psql/wizard.html:24
msgid "Create a database"
msgstr "ສ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:389
msgid "Set up a new database and user with the database wizard."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົວຊ່ວຍສ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:395
msgid "Add a website"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເວັບໄຊທ໌"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:396
msgid "Install WordPress or another app with the auto-installer."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ WordPress ຫຼືແອັບອື່ນດ້ວຍຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:407
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "ຂ້າມ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:410
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:572
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:410
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນຕໍ່"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:411
msgid "Please wait…"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ…"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:434
msgid "Recommended for websites that use .htaccess for rewrite rules."
msgstr "ແນະນຳສຳລັບເວັບໄຊທ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ .htaccess ສຳລັບກົດ rewrite."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:439
msgid ""
"Recommended for NodeJS and Python applications, and high-traffic sites."
msgstr ""
"ແນະນຳສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ NodeJS ແລະ Python, ພ້ອມທັງເວັບໄຊທ໌ທີ່ມີທຣາຟິກສູງ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:444
msgid "Recommended for WordPress websites, but only one PHP version."
msgstr "ແນະນຳສຳລັບເວັບໄຊທ໌ WordPress, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງ PHP ເວີຊັນດຽວ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:479
msgid "Nginx core bundled with Lua scripting for custom logic."
msgstr "ແກນ Nginx ພ້ອມສະຄຣິບ Lua ສຳລັບໂລຈິກແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:489
msgid "Can be better fine-tuned for any type of application."
msgstr "ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ດີກວ່າສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທຸກປະເພດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:494
msgid ""
"Recommended for WordPress sites - smaller image, lower resource usage, and "
"faster default query execution."
msgstr ""
"ແນະນຳສຳລັບເວັບໄຊທ໌ WordPress - ອິມເມດນ້ອຍກວ່າ, ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"ແລະປະມວນຜົນຄິວຣີໄດ້ໄວກວ່າໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

