msgstr "ບໍ່ມີ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:513
msgid "Don't configure backups now - you can set this up later from Backups."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງບໍ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຕອນນີ້ - ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ຈາກ Backups."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:515
msgid "Remote backups using the WebDAV protocol."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທາງໄກໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄອນ WebDAV."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:516
msgid "Remote backups to another server via SSH/SFTP."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີອື່ນຜ່ານ SSH/SFTP."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:539
msgid "Block common attacks (SQL injection, XSS, and more) on new domains."
msgstr "ບລັອກການໂຈມຕີທົ່ວໄປ (SQL injection, XSS, ແລະອື່ນໆ) ໃສ່ໂດເມນໃໝ່."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:540
msgid "New domains get no request filtering."
msgstr "ໂດເມນໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການກັ່ນຕອງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃດໆ."

