#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:604
msgid ""
"The latest version - recommended for the newest features and, performance."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຫລ້າສຸດ - ແນະນຳສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະປະສິດທິພາບໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:607
msgid ""
"Security fixes only - fine for older apps, but you should plan an upgrade."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພເທົ່ານັ້ນ - ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບແອັບເກົ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານຄວນວາງແຜນອັບເກຣດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:610
msgid ""
"Fully supported - use this if your apps aren't yet tested on the latest "
"version."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບເຕັມຮູບແບບ - "
"ໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ຖ້າແອັບຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກທົດສອບກັບເວີຊັນຫລ້າສຸດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:612
msgid ""
"No longer receives any patches - you should definitely plan an upgrade."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບແພັດຊ໌ໃດໆອີກຕໍ່ໄປ - ທ່ານຄວນວາງແຜນອັບເກຣດຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ."

