#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/files/backup_settings.html:109
msgid ""
"Parallelism level for \"gz\" (Gzip) compression defines how many blocks of "
"data are concurrently processed. Higher values result in faster compression."
" Default = 1. Setting this to 0 will use all available threads."
