msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂລະຫັດໂໝດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1062
msgid "Click to Edit"
msgstr "ຄລິກເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1108
msgid "Error checking maintenance mode"
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກວດສອບໂໝດບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1115
