msgstr "ໂໝດບຳລຸງຮັກສາຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1123
msgid "Maintenance mode is now disabled."
msgstr "ໂໝດບຳລຸງຮັກສາຖືກປິດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1140
msgid "Failed to change maintenance mode"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໂໝດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາບໍ່ສຳເລັດ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1154
msgid "Check whether a newer WordPress version is available."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າມີເວີຊັນ WordPress ໃໝ່ກວ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1221
msgid "Core"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ (Core)"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1222
msgid "Update preferences for WP core."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການອັບເດດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WP."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1227
msgid "Update WordPress automatically:"
msgstr "ອັບເດດ WordPress ອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1230
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1260
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1285
msgid "No, I will update manually when needed"
msgstr "ບໍ່, ຂ້ອຍຈະອັບເດດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1233
msgid "Yes, but only minor (security) updates"
msgstr "ແມ່ນ, ແຕ່ສະເພາະການອັບເດດຍ່ອຍ (ຄວາມປອດໄພ)"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1233
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "ແນະນຳ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1236
msgid "Yes, all (minor and major) updates"
msgstr "ແມ່ນ, ທຸກການອັບເດດ (ທັງຍ່ອຍ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່)"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1249
msgid "Update preferences for WP plugins."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການອັບເດດສຳລັບປລັກອິນ WP."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1254
msgid "Update plugins automatically:"
msgstr "ອັບເດດປລັກອິນອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1257
msgid "Yes, all plugins will be automatically updated"
msgstr "ແມ່ນ, ທຸກປລັກອິນຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1273
msgid "Update preferences for WP themes."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການອັບເດດສຳລັບທີມ WP."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1278
msgid "Update themes automatically:"
msgstr "ອັບເດດທີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1281
msgid "Yes, all themes will be automatically updated"
msgstr "ແມ່ນ, ທຸກທີມຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1296
msgid "Save Update Preferences"
