#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:25
msgid ""
"A cron job is a Linux command used to schedule tasks for future execution."
msgstr ""
"Cron job ແມ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ Linux ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:26
msgid ""
"It allows you to automate repetitive tasks, such as sending notifications or"
" running scripts at specific intervals."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳໆໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສົ່ງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"
" ຫຼື ການລັນສະຄຣິບຕາມເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:29
msgid "Crontab File Editor"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ Crontab"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:30
msgid ""
"Editing crontab file is intended for advanced users only. If you mistyped "
"the cron entry in the file, you will not be warned as opposed to when saving"
" cronjobs in table mode."
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ crontab ເໝາະສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານພິມຄຳສັ່ງຜິດ, "
"ລະບົບຈະບໍ່ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:37
msgid "Need Help?"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອບໍ?"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:58
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:279
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:59
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:63
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:68
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:73
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:78
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/server_info.html:116
msgid "Description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:59
msgid ""
"When the job should be executed. E.g. every 10 seconds or every night at 1 "
"AM."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນວຽກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທຸກ 10 ວິນາທີ ຫຼື ທຸກຄືນເວລາ 1 ໂມງເຊົ້າ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/system/cronjobs.html:60
msgid ""
"String, see scheduling format of the Go implementation of cron. E.g. @every "
"10s or 0 0 1 * * * (every night at 1 AM). Note: the format starts with "
"seconds, instead of minutes."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (String), ເບິ່ງຮູບແບບການກຳນົດເວລາຂອງ cron ໃນພາສາ Go. ຕົວຢ່າງ: @every"
" 10s ຫຼື 0 0 1 * * * (ທຸກຄືນເວລາ 1 ໂມງເຊົ້າ). ຫມາຍເຫດ: "
"ຮູບແບບນີ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ວິນາທີ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນນາທີ."

